## Security Best Practices ✅

✅ **Your API Key is Secure:**

- API key is stored ONLY in Cloudflare (not in your code)
- Browser can't access it directly
- Cloudflare encrypts it automatically
- OpenAI API requests come FROM Cloudflare, not YOUR browser

✅ **CORS Protection:**

- Worker allows requests only from your domain
- Other websites can't use your API key

